await test.step('AT-E10 then: 抽選は再現され、未確認の範囲と分母を示し、仮戦闘結果と実ゲーム結果を別に記録する', async () => {
  expect(analysis.limits).toEqual({ maxStates: 100000, maxTransitions: 10000, maxMs: 30000 });
  expect(analysis.truncated).toBe(true); expect(analysis.status).toBe('unknown');
  expect(analysis.findings.some(finding => finding.status === 'unknown' && /上限|未確認/.test(finding.message))).toBe(true);
  expect(analysis.coverage.scenes.total).toBe(1); expect(analysis.coverage.choices.total).toBe(3); const conditionTargets = [entry, loop, battle, end, toLoop, toEnd, toBattle, repeat, win]; expect(conditionTargets).toHaveLength(9); for (const target of conditionTargets) expect(target.kind === 'flow_node' ? target.data.gate : target.data.condition).toBeDefined(); expect(analysis.coverage.conditions.total).toBe(conditionTargets.length * 2); expect(analysis.coverage.conditions.total).toBe(18); expect([...analysis.coverage.conditions.ids].sort()).toEqual(conditionTargets.filter(target => target.id !== battle.id).map(target => `${target.id}:true`).sort()); expect(analysis.coverage.conditions.reached).toBe(8); expect(analysis.coverage.conditions.unknown).toBe(1);
  await page.getByLabel('試読する作品版', { exact: true }).selectOption(''); await page.getByLabel('試読の開始点', { exact: true }).selectOption(battle.id); await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'この状態から開始し直す', exact: true }).click();
  await expect(page.locator('.reader-trial-heading')).toContainText('未確認の条件');
  await page.locator('.runtime-external .runtime-variable').filter({ hasText: contract.name }).getByRole('button', { name: '仮値', exact: true }).click();
  const stub = page.getByRole('dialog', { name: '作者の仮値を設定', exact: true });
  await stub.getByLabel('値の型', { exact: true }).selectOption('boolean'); await stub.getByLabel('真偽値', { exact: true }).selectOption('true'); await stub.getByRole('button', { name: '仮値を適用', exact: true }).click();
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: '進行規則に従って次へ', exact: true }).click(); await page.getByRole('button', { name: '経路を記録', exact: true }).click();
  await expect(page.getByRole('status').filter({ hasText: '開始状態と経路を端末内に保存しました' })).toBeVisible();
  await navigate(page, /^作品・保存/); await page.getByRole('tab', { name: '目的別出力', exact: true }).click();
  await page.getByLabel('出力する公開範囲', { exact: true }).selectOption(profile.id); await page.getByLabel('出力目的', { exact: true }).selectOption('runtime_json'); await page.getByRole('button', { name: '内容を検査・プレビュー', exact: true }).click();
  await expect(page.locator('.export-result')).toContainText('runtime.json');
  const download = page.waitForEvent('download'); await page.locator('.export-artifact').getByRole('button', { name: 'この内容を保存', exact: true }).click(); const runtimeBytes = await readFile((await (await download).path())!), pkg = JSON.parse(runtimeBytes.toString());
  const game = await context.newPage(); await game.goto(new URL('examples/browser-game/index.html', page.url()).href);
  await game.getByLabel('ゲームが受け取るruntime.json', { exact: true }).setInputFiles({ name: 'runtime.json', mimeType: 'application/json', buffer: runtimeBytes }); await expect(game.getByRole('status')).toContainText('受領hash');
  await game.getByLabel('ゲーム開始入口', { exact: true }).selectOption(pkg.publicToRuntime[battle.id]); await game.getByRole('button', { name: `ゲームで勝利 (${contract.id})`, exact: true }).click(); await game.getByRole('button', { name: '測定結果でゲームの物語を開始', exact: true }).click(); await game.getByRole('button', { name: 'ゲームの規則で次へ', exact: true }).click();
  await expect(game.getByRole('status')).toContainText('terminal'); const response = game.waitForEvent('download'); await game.getByRole('button', { name: '受領hash・実結果の証跡を保存', exact: true }).click(); const receiptBytes = await readFile((await (await response).path())!); const receipt = JSON.parse(receiptBytes.toString()); expect(receipt.mode).toBe('actual'); await game.close();
  const handoff = page.locator('.game-handoff'); await handoff.locator('summary').click(); await handoff.getByLabel('受渡しの公開範囲', { exact: true }).selectOption(profile.id); await handoff.getByLabel('ゲームの受領証跡', { exact: true }).setInputFiles({ name: 'game-receipt.json', mimeType: 'application/json', buffer: receiptBytes }); await handoff.getByRole('button', { name: '受領hash・ID対応・実結果を検証', exact: true }).click(); await expect(handoff).toContainText('実行証跡による分類 actual'); await handoff.getByRole('button', { name: '検証したゲーム受領を保存', exact: true }).click(); await expect(handoff.getByRole('status').filter({ hasText: '表示版を確認' })).toBeVisible();
  const saved = await backup(page);
  expect(saved.project.entities.some(entity => entity.kind === 'trace' && entity.data.externalMode === 'stub')).toBe(true);
  expect(saved.project.entities.some(entity => entity.kind === 'note' && entity.data.handoffReceipt?.mode === 'actual')).toBe(true);
  await attachObservation(info, 'AT-E10-local-measurement', { independentReceiverReceipt: receipt, actualTargetGame: 'not_run: Linux browser receiver evidence does not establish the target external engine or a physical device result' });
});

